spec: S13-02, S13-04, S13-06, S01-17

`--json ?` lists every field of the ticket-13 verbs and exits without touching launchd or the
store — on any platform.

```console
$ ANNOTARY_DAEMON_OS=linux annotary daemon status --json ?
state pid since url port store log plist installed loaded label version

$ ANNOTARY_DAEMON_OS=linux annotary daemon install --json ?
state pid since url port store log plist installed loaded label version

$ ANNOTARY_DAEMON_OS=linux annotary daemon uninstall --json ?
plist removed stopped label

$ annotary export backup.tar --json ?
file blobs bytes size schema_version tenant_id store live

```
